#: Bulldozer.php:96
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your theme %1$s requires at least Bulldozer %2$s. You have %3$s installed. "
"Please update by setting the version number like this in your composer file: "
"<code>highground/bulldozer\": \"^%2$s\"</code>"
msgstr ""
"Voor je thema %1$s is minimaal Bulldozer %2$s vereist. Je hebt %3$s "
"geïnstalleerd. Werk dit bij door het versienummer als volgt in je Composer-"
"bestand in te stellen: <code>„highground/bulldozer”: „^%2$s”</code>"

